  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So the Trust system is something that should be improved upon, at least the way it visualizes the ranks, i as for one would like to see the color only show up around the rank name when having the quick menu up.\n\nThis is so that the badge color wont be put in your face and may be strange for a new user to see there is so many colors going about.\n\nThat being said, All user nameplates from New User and above should be added as the normal green color and the \"troll\" rank should be colorized Red to see these malicious users faster.\n\nAnd Guest/Visitors as Light blue or an different color than new user to indicate they may need help to get around the place.",
